      <li>Faul, F., Erdfelder, E., Buchner, A., &amp; Lang, A.-G. (2009). Statistical power analyses using G*Power 3.1: Tests for correlation and regression analyses. <em>Behavior Research Methods</em>, <em>41</em>(4), 1149–1160. https://doi.org/10.3758/BRM.41.4.1149</li>
      <li>Field, A. (2018). <em>Discovering statistics using IBM SPSS Statistics</em> (5th ed.). Sage.</li>
