      <li>Hair, J. F., Risher, J. J., Sarstedt, M., &amp; Ringle, C. M. (2019). When to use and how to report the results of PLS-SEM. <em>European Business Review</em>, <em>31</em>(1), 2–24. https://doi.org/10.1108/EBR-11-2018-0203</li>
