      <li>Zhao, X., Lynch, J. G., Jr., &amp; Chen, Q. (2010). Reconsidering Baron and Kenny: Myths and truths about mediation analysis. <em>Journal of Consumer Research</em>, <em>37</em>(2), 197–206. https://doi.org/10.1086/651257</li>
    </ul>
  </Fragment>
</ToolLayout>
